# A heater phase phi in one arm sends sin^2(phi/2) = 1.000 of the power to the bar port.

title Mach-Zehnder switch, phase 1.000 pi
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 21

comp c1 coupler kappa=0.5
comp c2 coupler kappa=0.5
comp a waveguide length=100.0
comp b waveguide length=100.0
comp h phase phi=3.141592653590
link c1.3 a.1
link c1.4 b.1
port in c1.1
port in2 c1.2
port bar c2.3
port cross c2.4
link a.2 h.1
link h.2 c2.1
link b.2 c2.2

expect lossless
expect level bar 1.55 0.00000000 1e-6
expect below cross -200
